{"meta":{"format_version":"4.10","model_format":"free","box_uv":false},"name":"goblin_mage","model_identifier":"goblin_mage","visible_box":[1,1,0],"variable_placeholders":"","variable_placeholder_buttons":[],"timeline_setups":[],"unhandled_root_fields":{"description":"# goblin_mage\n\nGoblin mage (C4), 1.2 m = 43 u (hunched ~41 u under its hood).\n\nA wiry 1.2 m goblin, green-grey skin, hunched back and knobbly hump, an oversized head with huge swept ears, a hooked nose, a wide toothy mouth and glowing yellow eyes, long arms (hands at the knee), leather scraps. Hunched under a ragged hide cloak (hood, mantle, back panel and thigh flaps) hung with pebbles on cords; carries a gnarled two-piece stick with a glowing green hexstone tied to the tip. Shared goblin rig: baseline humanoid skeleton and slot names (slot_hand_r, slot_hand_l, slot_head on the scalp, slot_back between the shoulder blades).\n\n- Cubes: 35 (all unrotated unless noted). Texture 128x64, 1 px per unit, embedded.\n- Rest bounds (body, no held items): x -13.0..13.0, y 0.0..45.5, z -7.5..6.5 (faces -Z).\n\n## Hit box\n\n- one box 16 x 42 x 12 (w x h x d), centred on x = 0, z = 0, from y = 0\n\n## Clips\n\n| clip | length (s) | loop | notes |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| `idle` | 2 | loop |  |\n| `walk` | 0.7 | loop |  |\n| `run` | 0.42 | loop |  |\n| `flee` | 0.38 | loop | arms flung up, looking back over its shoulder, panicked run (loop) |\n| `taunt` | 1.6 | once | hops side to side, waggles its head and slaps its backside (1.6 s) |\n| `aggro` | 1 | once | hop and lunge (1.0 s) |\n| `injured` | 0.45 | once | flinch |\n| `death` | 1.2 | hold | topples forward; holds; rests on y = 0 |\n| `cast_snuff` | 1 | once | key 0.45 s: flicks the stick at a light (it goes out) |\n| `cast_stumble` | 1 | once | a jabbing hex at the target's legs: jabs at 0.3 and 0.55 s; key 0.55 s |\n| `cast_spark` | 1.2 | once | hexstone raised 0.4, key 0.6 s: throws a small fire bolt from fx_hex |\n\n## Move speeds (in-place cycles; stride matched to these)\n\n- `walk`: 39.1 u/s (1.10 m/s), cycle 0.7 s, 27.4 u per cycle\n- `run`: 135.1 u/s (3.80 m/s), cycle 0.42 s, 56.7 u per cycle\n- `flee`: 148.6 u/s (4.18 m/s), cycle 0.38 s, 56.5 u per cycle\n\n## Key times\n\n- `cast_snuff`: key 0.45 s: flicks the stick at a light (it goes out)\n- `cast_stumble`: a jabbing hex at the target's legs: jabs at 0.3 and 0.55 s; key 0.55 s\n- `cast_spark`: hexstone raised 0.4, key 0.6 s: throws a small fire bolt from fx_hex\n\n## Attachment points (empty groups, pivot in model units)\n\n- `slot_head` on `head` at (0, 45.5, 0)\n- `slot_back` on `torso` at (0, 31, 6)\n- `slot_quiver` on `torso` at (2.5, 31, 5)\n- `slot_shoulder_r` on `torso` at (4, 35.5, 0)\n- `slot_carry` on `torso` at (0, 27, -5)\n- `slot_hand_r` on `hand_r` at (7, 11, 0)\n- `slot_shield_l` on `arm_lower_l` at (-10, 18.5, 0)\n- `slot_hand_l` on `hand_l` at (-7, 11, 0)\n- `slot_hip_r` on `hips` at (5.5, 21, 2.5)\n- `slot_hip_l` on `hips` at (-5.5, 21, 2.5)\n- `fx_hex` on `hexstick` at (7.5, 11.75, -20.5)\n- `fx_hand_l` on `hand_l` at (-7, 9, -1)\n\n## Preview / carried items in slots\n\n- `hexstick` (visible, under slot_hand_r): 28 u gnarled stick, tip (hexstone) along -Z\n\n## Notes\n\n- Lit cubes: glow_eye_r / glow_eye_l, glow_hexstone.\n- `fx_hex`: centre of the hexstone (spell spawn); `fx_hand_l`: left palm.\n- Variant texture: goblin_mage_red_hex.png (orange-red hexstone, greyer cloak).\n"},"description":"# goblin_mage\n\nGoblin mage (C4), 1.2 m = 43 u (hunched ~41 u under its hood).\n\nA wiry 1.2 m goblin, green-grey skin, hunched back and knobbly hump, an oversized head with huge swept ears, a hooked nose, a wide toothy mouth and glowing yellow eyes, long arms (hands at the knee), leather scraps. Hunched under a ragged hide cloak (hood, mantle, back panel and thigh flaps) hung with pebbles on cords; carries a gnarled two-piece stick with a glowing green hexstone tied to the tip. Shared goblin rig: baseline humanoid skeleton and slot names (slot_hand_r, slot_hand_l, slot_head on the scalp, slot_back between the shoulder blades).\n\n- Cubes: 35 (all unrotated unless noted). Texture 128x64, 1 px per unit, embedded.\n- Rest bounds (body, no held items): x -13.0..13.0, y 0.0..45.5, z -7.5..6.5 (faces -Z).\n\n## Hit box\n\n- one box 16 x 42 x 12 (w x h x d), centred on x = 0, z = 0, from y = 0\n\n## Clips\n\n| clip | length (s) | loop | notes |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| `idle` | 2 | loop |  |\n| `walk` | 0.7 | loop |  |\n| `run` | 0.42 | loop |  |\n| `flee` | 0.38 | loop | arms flung up, looking back over its shoulder, panicked run (loop) |\n| `taunt` | 1.6 | once | hops side to side, waggles its head and slaps its backside (1.6 s) |\n| `aggro` | 1 | once | hop and lunge (1.0 s) |\n| `injured` | 0.45 | once | flinch |\n| `death` | 1.2 | hold | topples forward; holds; rests on y = 0 |\n| `cast_snuff` | 1 | once | key 0.45 s: flicks the stick at a light (it goes out) |\n| `cast_stumble` | 1 | once | a jabbing hex at the target's legs: jabs at 0.3 and 0.55 s; key 0.55 s |\n| `cast_spark` | 1.2 | once | hexstone raised 0.4, key 0.6 s: throws a small fire bolt from fx_hex |\n\n## Move speeds (in-place cycles; stride matched to these)\n\n- `walk`: 39.1 u/s (1.10 m/s), cycle 0.7 s, 27.4 u per cycle\n- `run`: 135.1 u/s (3.80 m/s), cycle 0.42 s, 56.7 u per cycle\n- `flee`: 148.6 u/s (4.18 m/s), cycle 0.38 s, 56.5 u per cycle\n\n## Key times\n\n- `cast_snuff`: key 0.45 s: flicks the stick at a light (it goes out)\n- `cast_stumble`: a jabbing hex at the target's legs: jabs at 0.3 and 0.55 s; key 0.55 s\n- `cast_spark`: hexstone raised 0.4, key 0.6 s: throws a small fire bolt from fx_hex\n\n## Attachment points (empty groups, pivot in model units)\n\n- `slot_head` on `head` at (0, 45.5, 0)\n- `slot_back` on `torso` at (0, 31, 6)\n- `slot_quiver` on `torso` at (2.5, 31, 5)\n- `slot_shoulder_r` on `torso` at (4, 35.5, 0)\n- `slot_carry` on `torso` at (0, 27, -5)\n- `slot_hand_r` on `hand_r` at (7, 11, 0)\n- `slot_shield_l` on `arm_lower_l` at (-10, 18.5, 0)\n- `slot_hand_l` on `hand_l` at (-7, 11, 0)\n- `slot_hip_r` on `hips` at (5.5, 21, 2.5)\n- `slot_hip_l` on `hips` at (-5.5, 21, 2.5)\n- `fx_hex` on `hexstick` at (7.5, 11.75, -20.5)\n- `fx_hand_l` on `hand_l` at (-7, 9, -1)\n\n## Preview / carried items in slots\n\n- `hexstick` (visible, under slot_hand_r): 28 u gnarled stick, tip (hexstone) along -Z\n\n## Notes\n\n- Lit cubes: glow_eye_r / glow_eye_l, glow_hexstone.\n- `fx_hex`: centre of the hexstone (spell spawn); `fx_hand_l`: left palm.\n- Variant texture: goblin_mage_red_hex.png (orange-red hexstone, greyer cloak).\n","resolution":{"width":128,"height":64},"elements":[{"name":"pelvis","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":false,"light_emission":0,"render_order":"default","allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-4.5,18.0,-3.0],"to":[4.5,22.0,3.0],"autouv":0,"color":0,"inflate":0.0,"origin":[0.0,18.0,0.0],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[51,47,60.0,51.0],"texture":0},"east":{"uv":[87,47,93.0,51.0],"texture":0},"south":{"uv":[60,47,69.0,51.0],"texture":0},"west":{"uv":[93,47,99.0,51.0],"texture":0},"up":{"uv":[117,40,126.0,46.0],"texture":0},"down":{"uv":[0,47,9.0,53.0],"texture":0}},"type":"cube","uuid":"3159e984-70ca-5576-88a2-a506ed41f849"},{"name":"chest","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":false,"light_emission":0,"render_order":"default","allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-5.5,22.0,-3.5],"to":[5.5,34.0,3.5],"autouv":0,"color":0,"inflate":0.0,"origin":[0.0,22.0,0.0],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[36,0,47.0,12.0],"texture":0},"east":{"uv":[58,0,65.0,12.0],"texture":0},"south":{"uv":[47,0,58.0,12.0],"texture":0},"west":{"uv":[65,0,72.0,12.0],"texture":0},"up":{"uv":[70,31,81.0,38.0],"texture":0},"down":{"uv":[81,31,92.0,38.0],"texture":0}},"type":"cube","uuid":"c713904b-9aa7-545d-ba04-e7bf7d84af9e"},{"name":"neck","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":false,"light_emission":0,"render_order":"default","allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-1.5,34.0,-1.5],"to":[1.5,35.0,1.5],"autouv":0,"color":0,